  ✓ Audit input/provenance integrity and program fidelity; preserve differential evidence
  ✓ Rebuild semantics and proofs from clean scratch; run concrete and positive proof targets
  ✓ Review claim adequacy, real-program pinning, and all K rules exhaustively
  ✓ Create and run a fresh false mutation for non-vacuity
  ✓ Account for proven versus assumed boundaries and write REVIEW.md with verdict
